        "Transitions status: delivered(3) → confirmed(4).",
        "Stores the recipient's 64-byte Ed25519 signature and signer metadata.",
        "",
        "NOTE FOR BRIDGE: For on-chain Ed25519 verification, the bridge must",
        "include a Solana ed25519_program instruction in the SAME transaction,",
        "immediately before this instruction. The program does NOT verify the",
        "signature bytes here — it stores them for off-chain audit. If your",
        "security model requires on-chain verification, add the",
        "Instructions sysvar check here.",
        "",
        "Performance scoring is triggered automatically UNLESS from_org_type == FCA (3).",
        "",
        "C-1: authority must equal bridge_config.bridge_authority."
